        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>3-1/2 x 3-1/2 x 1/4 Radius Residential Solid Brass Hinge, Baldwin, 1435.xxx.I</b>\r\n<p>Baldwin hinges are made from extruded brass machined for precise installation and smooth movement.  They are beveled on the inside leaf to obtain a tight fit when viewing the hinge in a closed position and furnished with stainless steel, rustproof pins for added durability.  </p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes one hinge and matching solid brass flathead, Phillips Drive 12 each #10 x 1\" wood screws and standard button finial tip. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Radius:  1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.093\"</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: 12 ea. #10 x 1\" Phillips</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available in 22 finishes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually</p>",
